		<p style="padding: 20px; width:100%; background:#ffffff; font-size:18px;"><strong>Welcome </strong>to the website for the All-domain Anomaly Resolution Office (AARO).&nbsp; Our&nbsp;team of experts leads the U.S. government&rsquo;s efforts to address Unidentified&nbsp;Anomalous Phenomena (UAP) using a rigorous scientific framework and a data-driven&nbsp;approach.&nbsp;Thank you for visiting.</p>

